Header Directory for Transport in the "rtl" library
Chris Ahlstrom
2022-06-07 to 2025-09-14

This is the home for JACK transport header files, and other transports if
we ever implement them, such as MIDI Clock.

The "rtl" project adds JACK Transport support to the "RtMidi" library.

